cp|8|AT|^^
^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|There are very few hands where 5@C is a better contract than 3N. Even on those rare occasions unless you are sure you are missing a stopper and will lose 5 tricks off the top you should bid 3N.|
