mb|2C|mb|P|mb|2D|mb|P|mb|2S|mb|P|mb|3S|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|3@S is the 100% correct bid by North. Once I open 2@C we are in a game forcing auction and 3@S shows slam interest. If North incorrectly bid 4@S, that would show a hand with 3+ spades and no aces or kings. When you are in a game forcing auction the principle of ^*B"Fast Arrival"^*n applies.|
